            "detailed_description": "<h1>Características</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303720/extras/c50cf15ca2474e8d29622a35387de3cb.avif?t=1786222036\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Nova atualização</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agora totalmente compatível com o Valve Steam Deck. Funciona na perfeição em portáteis: ROG Ally e ROG Ally Xbox, MSI Claw</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303720/extras/Gear-Steam-Deck-KAZ_edited2_600.png?t=1786222036\" /></span></p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Num futuro distante, #KILLALLZOMBIES lança civis num desporto de sobrevivência no qual uma população voraz de zombies é libertada em nome do entretenimento desportivo. Com uma horda coletiva capaz de ultrapassar os 1000 zombies, os espectadores televisivos votam em quantos e que tipos de zombies ou obstáculos querem libertar para tornar a tua sobrevivência ainda mais difícil.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303720/extras/944fb055cbe7b1e9d76593a7e24e50e3.poster.avif?t=1786222036\" width=482 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303720/extras/944fb055cbe7b1e9d76593a7e24e50e3.webm?t=1786222036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303720/extras/944fb055cbe7b1e9d76593a7e24e50e3.mp4?t=1786222036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Funcionalidades</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hordas de zombies para enfrentar numa arena interativa em constante mudança<br></li><li>Interações por transmissão em direto que permitem aos espectadores influenciar a jogabilidade enquanto acompanham a emissão em direto na Twitch<br></li><li>Três modos de jogo: Sobrevivência, Cooperativo local e Defende o Cofre <br></li><li>Mais de 100 vantagens poderosas e comandos do chat da Twitch<br></li><li>Perigosos bosses zombies!<br></li><li>Vasto arsenal de armas e diversos tipos de munições</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303720/extras/b93823ddb376185e2503b60f2d249c1e.poster.avif?t=1786222036\" width=482 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303720/extras/b93823ddb376185e2503b60f2d249c1e.webm?t=1786222036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303720/extras/b93823ddb376185e2503b60f2d249c1e.mp4?t=1786222036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303720/extras/cf5852b438e7bdd579953134380dcc59.poster.avif?t=1786222036\" width=482 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303720/extras/cf5852b438e7bdd579953134380dcc59.webm?t=1786222036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303720/extras/cf5852b438e7bdd579953134380dcc59.mp4?t=1786222036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303720/extras/a425f02acc179b4dd4de2aeb98cdf64c.poster.avif?t=1786222036\" width=482 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/303720/extras/a425f02acc179b4dd4de2aeb98cdf64c.webm?t=1786222036\" type=\"video/webm; code